	(text "J5001 pin 1 is intentionally NC (RB-00.5 R5): Rev A tied it to GND = 0-ohm body-to-GND contact. Retention pads MP = no net.\nMinimum impedance patient -> GND: electrodes >= 10 kohm (R n01/R n02), reference >= 100 kohm (R5002)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3a536d16-abbe-5715-8361-6bf305704ca4")
	)
	(text "DESIGN INTENT (this sheet):\n- AFE_3V0 -> 100k/100k -> VCM_DIV (1uF+100nF) -> R5005 10k (RB-00.5 R6b) -> U503A follower -> VCM\n- J5001 pin 1 = NC, pin 2 = RLD_SAFE <- R5002 100k 0805 <- VCM (RB-00.5 R5). No patient contact to GND.\n- U503 B/C/D unused: unity followers with +IN on VCM (mid-supply, TI unused-amp guidance). No DRL loop."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 256.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6f978e06-9b0b-5ca0-a3f3-3db8744a1a45")
	)
	(text "VCM / PATIENT REFERENCE - passive buffered bias electrode (not a driven-right-leg loop)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8a8bd787-2f96-5468-a722-be83e974044a")
	)
	(text "AFE op-amp supplies (TLV9064 unit E) with local 100 nF decoupling"
